{"id":"word:hebrew:H6342","type":"word","title":"פָּחַד","subtitle":"H6342 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to be startled (by a sudden alarm); hence, to fear in general","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to פָּחַד (H6342) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"פָּחַד (pâchad) means to be startled (by a sudden alarm); hence, to fear in general First listed occurrence: Deut 28 66."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"פָּחַד","transliteration":"pâchad","pronunciation":"paw-kkad'","strong":"H6342","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6342","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וּ/פָֽחַדְתָּ֙","תִּפְחָ֔ד","וּ/פָחֲד֧וּ","אֶפְחָ֑ד","וּ/פָחַ֗ד"],"morphs":[["HVqp3cp",6],["HVqi2ms",2],["HC/Vqq3cp",2],["HVqi1cs",2],["HC/Vqq3ms",2],["HVqi3mp",2],["HC/Vqq2ms",1],["HVqi3ms",1],["HVqj2mp",1],["HC/Vpw2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to be startled (by a sudden alarm); hence, to fear in general","usage":"be afraid, stand in awe, (be in) fear, make to shake.","full":"H6342. pachad מָּחַד verb dread, be in dread, in awe (Late Hebrew Hithpa`el (rare), Ecclus 41:12 Imperative על פחד fear for ; מַּחְדָּא ᵑ7 n.); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular מָּחַד Psa 119:161 , ׳וּפ consecutive Isa 19:16 ; 60:5 ; 1 singular מָּחַדְתִּי Job 3:25 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִפְחָ֑ד Isa 19:17 ; 2 masculine singular תִּפְחָ֑ד Deut 28:67 +, etc.; — 1 be in dread , absolute Deut 28:66 ; Isa 12:2 ; 33:14 ; 44:8 , 11 ; Psa 78:53 ; Prov 3:24 ; פ ׳לֹא Jer 36:24 sign of callousness; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb מַּחַד Deut 28:67 ; Job 3:25 ; Psa 14:5 = 53:6 ; with מִן person Isa 19:17 ; Job 23:15 ; Psa 27:1 (|| יָרֵא ), compare 119:161 , and (with מִמְּנֵי ) Isa 19:16 ; with עַל of thing Jer 33:9 (+ רָֽגְזוּ ); with אֶל , pregnantly, turn in dread to each other 36:16 , submitting to ׳י Hosea 3:5 ; Micah 7:17 (|| יָרֵא ). 2 be in awe (at ׳י s favour), absolute, Isa 60:5 . Pi`el be in great dread, Imperfect 2masculine singular וַתְּפַחֵד Isa 51:13 , with מִמְּנֵי thing; Participle absolute מְפַחֵד Prov 28:14 deeply dreading (that is, sin). Hiph`il Perfect 3masculine singular הִפְחַיד Job 4:14 filled my bones with dread.","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Deut 28 66","keyReferences":["Deut 28 66","Deut 28 67","Hos 3 5","Isa 12 2","Isa 19 16","Isa 19 17","Isa 33 14","Isa 44 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Deut 28 66","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":66,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/פָֽחַדְתָּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 28 67","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":67,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּפְחָ֔ד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi2ms"},{"reference":"Hos 3 5","book":"Hos","chapter":3,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/פָחֲד֧וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq3cp"},{"reference":"Isa 12 2","book":"Isa","chapter":12,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֶפְחָ֑ד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi1cs"},{"reference":"Isa 19 16","book":"Isa","chapter":19,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/פָחַ֗ד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq3ms"},{"reference":"Isa 19 17","book":"Isa","chapter":19,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִפְחָ֑ד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3ms"},{"reference":"Isa 33 14","book":"Isa","chapter":33,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּחֲד֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3cp"},{"reference":"Isa 44 8","book":"Isa","chapter":44,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּפְחֲדוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqj2mp"},{"reference":"Isa 44 11","book":"Isa","chapter":44,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יִפְחֲד֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3mp"},{"reference":"Isa 51 13","book":"Isa","chapter":51,"verse":13,"en